      "description": "The TIGHT dual: the Doob martingale of the discounted-intrinsic process, with the one-step conditional expectation E[Y_k|S_{k-1}] estimated by nested simulation (128 next-step states resampled from the panel's own one-step returns, payoff re-evaluated there). A genuine martingale (valid upper bound) that tracks the option far better than a single hedge (~6.5 vs ~9.7). The true price lies in [american_put, dual_tight].",
